  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accountable Local Governance Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The West Bank/Gaza Accountable Local Governance Activity (ALG) supports local government units to respond to immediate needs while strengthening the foundation for resilient longer-term service delivery improvements and citizen accountability. ALG builds on previous USAID local government and service delivery programs while complementing ongoing activities focused on water, youth, civil society, private sector engagement, and construction.</narrative>
  </description>
